    StartDate+BirthMonth) — so whatever Apply carried is overwritten before
    anything reads it.
  - RunWithOverrides/preparedWithOverrides same path (prepare.From).
No test asserts CurrentAge/SpouseAge either way (grep of overrides_test.go,
plan/overrides_test.go, settings_test.go: zero hits), so this is an
